// Launch-VsDevShell.PS1 Proxy Execution | T1216.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_lolbin_launch_vsdevshell.yml
DeviceProcessEvents
| where ProcessCommandLine contains "Launch-VsDevShell.ps1" and (ProcessCommandLine contains "VsWherePath " or ProcessCommandLine contains "VsInstallationPath ")
